    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44282" root="&#xA;                        هرق&#xA;                    " body-key="h1">
                        
                            4
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَهْرِقْ عَنْكَ مِنَ الظَّهِيرَةِ</span></b> 
                        , <i>i. q.</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْرِدْ</span>, q. v. (IAar,
in TA, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فيح</span>.) See 4 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">روق</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَرَاقَهُ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَهْراَقَهُ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَرَقَهُ</span></b> , aor. 
    
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَرَقَ</span></b> 
                        , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَرْقٌ</span>, <i>He
poured it out,</i> or <i>forth:</i> see 4 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">روق</span>.
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَرِيقُوا عَنْكُمْ أَوَّلَ اللَّيْلِ</span>, (in the K, erroneously,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَيْكُمْ</span>,) <i>Alight ye in the first of the night:</i> (TA:)
or <i>disburden yourselves</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنْزِلُوا عنكم</span>): or <i>relieve,</i>
or <i>rest, yourselves;</i> which seems to be generally
meant by <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هريقوا عنكم</span>.

